        <mxCell id="n35" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px;color:#007F3B&quot;&gt;Level 1 Standard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#425563&quot;&gt;The innermost box. Seven checks start here. Produce the analysis well and record enough that someone could re-run it.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#231F20;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
